#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:4
msgid "v2.9.7"
msgstr "v2.9.7"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.9.7 is an OpenMV-specific release focused on dramatically faster and more"
" reliable firmware flashing through the built-in bootloader, with high-speed"
" USB support, a hardened serial driver, and batch video conversion. It "
"remains built on Qt Creator 4.0.2 (no rebase in this range), and there are "
"no breaking changes for existing projects."
msgstr ""
"v2.9.7 是專屬於 OpenMV 的發行版本，聚焦於透過內建開機載入程式進行更快速、更可靠的韌體燒錄，並支援高速 "
"USB、強化的序列驅動程式，以及批次影片轉換。本版本仍建構於 Qt Creator 4.0.2 "
"之上（此範圍內未重新基底化），且對既有專案沒有破壞性變更。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本頁內容"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "重點摘要"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Faster firmware flashing.** The built-in bootloader now batches non-posted"
" USB packets and uses high-speed (480 Mb/s) endpoint sizing instead of one "
"slow padded packet per chunk with a fixed delay after each."
msgstr ""
"**更快速的韌體燒錄。** 內建開機載入程式現在會批次處理非延遲（non-posted）USB 封包，並使用高速（480 "
"Mb/s）端點大小，而非每個區塊一個緩慢的填補封包並在每次之後加上固定延遲。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:23
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Cam H7 Pro DFU support** is now recognized "
"(``OMV4_H7_PRO_32768_SDRAM``), along with the high-speed bootloader."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Cam H7 Pro DFU 支援** 現在已可辨識（\\ ``OMV4_H7_PRO_32768_SDRAM``\\ "
"），並支援高速開機載入程式。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Hardened serial driver** for 480 Mb/s high-speed mode, with 64 MB "
"read/write buffers and graceful recovery when the OS stalls returning data."
msgstr "**強化的序列驅動程式** 適用於 480 Mb/s 高速模式，具有 64 MB 讀寫緩衝區，並在作業系統停滯傳回資料時能優雅復原。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Batch Convert Video.** Selecting multiple source files now converts them "
"all at once after a single prompt for output settings."
msgstr "**批次轉換影片。** 選取多個來源檔案後，現在只需提示一次輸出設定即可一次全部轉換。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Release notes preview.** The *Install Latest Development Release* dialog "
"now downloads and shows the GitHub release notes before asking to flash."
msgstr ""
"**發行說明預覽。** *Install Latest Development Release* 對話框現在會在詢問是否燒錄前下載並顯示 GitHub "
"發行說明。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:33
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:35
msgid ""
"The **Convert Video** tool now supports batch conversion: selecting multiple"
" source files prompts once for an output folder, format, rescale width, and "
"frame-skip, then converts all files at once (`864a0babd "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/864a0babd>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Convert Video** "
"工具現在支援批次轉換：選取多個來源檔案時只會提示一次輸出資料夾、格式、重新縮放寬度與略過影格設定，然後一次轉換所有檔案（\\ `864a0babd "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/864a0babd>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:39
msgid ""
"The **Install Latest Development Release** dialog now downloads the GitHub "
"release page and displays the rendered release notes (the page's ``markdown-"
"body`` section) in a read-only scrollable view before asking to flash, "
"behind a *Downloading* progress dialog (`3a7805b4f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3a7805b4f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Install Latest Development Release** 對話框現在會下載 GitHub "
"發行頁面，並在詢問是否燒錄前於唯讀可捲動的檢視中顯示算繪後的發行說明（頁面的 ``markdown-body`` 區段），背後並有 "
"*Downloading* 進度對話框（\\ `3a7805b4f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3a7805b4f>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:46
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他變更與改進"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Faster bootloader flashing.** Firmware flashing through the built-in "
"bootloader is dramatically faster, using batched non-posted USB packets and "
"high-speed (480 Mb/s) endpoint sizing instead of one slow padded packet per "
"chunk with a fixed delay after each (`c2910aeef "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c2910aeef>`__, `66031209e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/66031209e>`__, `a82783208 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a82783208>`__, `a5e185d96 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a5e185d96>`__, `3d0b2e98b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3d0b2e98b>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**更快速的開機載入程式燒錄。** 透過內建開機載入程式進行韌體燒錄的速度大幅提升，採用批次處理的非延遲（non-posted）USB "
"封包與高速（480 Mb/s）端點大小，而非每個區塊一個緩慢的填補封包並在每次之後加上固定延遲（\\ `c2910aeef "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c2910aeef>`__\\ 、\\ `66031209e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/66031209e>`__\\ 、\\ `a82783208 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a82783208>`__\\ 、\\ `a5e185d96 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a5e185d96>`__\\ 、\\ `3d0b2e98b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3d0b2e98b>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:57
msgid ""
"**Hardened serial driver** for 480 Mb/s high-speed mode: 64 MB read/write "
"buffers, Windows ``SetupComm`` buffer sizing on open, and graceful recovery "
"(zero-fill) when the OS accepts USB data but stalls returning it to the "
"application (`d0b3bcdb7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d0b3bcdb7>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**強化的序列驅動程式** 適用於 480 Mb/s 高速模式：64 MB 讀寫緩衝區、開啟時進行 Windows ``SetupComm`` "
"緩衝區大小設定，並在作業系統接受 USB 資料但停滯而未傳回給應用程式時優雅復原（以零填補）（\\ `d0b3bcdb7 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d0b3bcdb7>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:62
msgid ""
"Firmware flashing now runs faster on Windows and Linux by skipping the "
"macOS-only endpoint padding and sync-query packets used to work around macOS"
" USB behavior (`711281155 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/711281155>`__)."
msgstr ""
"韌體燒錄現在在 Windows 與 Linux 上執行得更快，方法是略過僅供 macOS 使用、用於規避 macOS USB "
"行為的端點填補與同步查詢封包（\\ `711281155 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/711281155>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:66
msgid ""
"The serial terminal now draws a blinking text cursor (`75e52095d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/75e52095d>`__)."
msgstr ""
"序列終端機現在會繪製閃爍的文字游標（\\ `75e52095d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/75e52095d>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:68
msgid ""
"Bootloader/DFU recovery wording now describes a DFU bootloader reset that "
"repairs the regular bootloader, guiding the user to remove the "
"``BOOT``/``RST`` jumper and reconnect rather than implying a direct firmware"
" upgrade (`9e436cdc0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9e436cdc0>`__)."
msgstr ""
"開機載入程式/DFU 復原的文字用語現在會描述用以修復一般開機載入程式的 DFU 開機載入程式重設流程，引導使用者移除 ``BOOT``/``RST``"
" 跳線並重新連接，而非暗示直接進行韌體升級（\\ `9e436cdc0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9e436cdc0>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:74
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "錯誤修正"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:76
msgid ""
"Fixed firmware programming reliability on Linux and on VMs: flash "
"write/erase success is now AND-accumulated across batched packets, the port "
"``flush()`` return is ignored, and stalled bootloader transfers re-issue the"
" correct query for bootloader vs normal mode (`a82783208 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a82783208>`__, `f76406597 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f76406597>`__)."
msgstr ""
"修正了在 Linux 與虛擬機器上的韌體程式化可靠性：快閃記憶體寫入/清除的成功狀態現在會跨批次封包以 AND 方式累積、連接埠的 "
"``flush()`` 傳回值會被忽略，且停滯的開機載入程式傳輸會針對開機載入程式模式與一般模式重新發出正確的查詢（\\ `a82783208 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a82783208>`__\\ 、\\ `f76406597 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f76406597>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:82
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash when removing stale board USB VID/PID mappings by erasing the "
"iterator after, not before, the dependent map lookups (`5950b0851 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5950b0851>`__)."
msgstr ""
"修正了移除過時的開發板 USB VID/PID 對應時的當機問題，方法是在相依的對應查詢之後（而非之前）抹除迭代器（\\ `5950b0851 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5950b0851>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:85
msgid ""
"Corrected the auto-loaded ``helloworld.py`` path and the post-registration "
"instructions to the new examples layout (``Examples > HelloWorld`` instead "
"of ``Examples > OpenMV > Basics``) (`def9b7dad "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/def9b7dad>`__)."
msgstr ""
"更正了自動載入的 ``helloworld.py`` 路徑以及註冊後的指示，使其符合新的範例配置（使用 ``Examples > "
"HelloWorld`` 而非 ``Examples > OpenMV > Basics``\\ ）（\\ `def9b7dad "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/def9b7dad>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:91
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "平台與工具支援"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:93
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 4.0.2."
msgstr "**Qt Creator 基礎版本：** 4.0.2。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:94
msgid ""
"Added **DFU support for the OpenMV Cam H7 Pro** "
"(``OMV4_H7_PRO_32768_SDRAM``) and recognition of the high-speed bootloader "
"serial number ``000000000010`` (`c2910aeef <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c2910aeef>`__)."
msgstr ""
"新增 **OpenMV Cam H7 Pro 的 DFU 支援**\\ （\\ ``OMV4_H7_PRO_32768_SDRAM``\\ "
"），並可辨識高速開機載入程式序號 ``000000000010``\\ （\\ `c2910aeef "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c2910aeef>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:97
msgid ""
"Updated the bundled OpenMV firmware to **v4.3.2** and refreshed the per-"
"board firmware images (``firmware.bin`` plus ``firmware.dfu``, "
"``firmware.hex``, or ``firmware.uf2`` depending on the board), bootloader, "
"and UVC images. OPENMV2, OPENMV3, OPENMV4, OPENMV4P, OPENMVPT, NICLAV, and "
"PORTENTA ship ``firmware.bin``/``firmware.dfu``; NANO33 ships "
"``firmware.bin``/``firmware.hex``; ARDUINO_NANO_RP2040_CONNECT ships "
"``firmware.bin``/``firmware.uf2``. Brand-new firmware, bootloader, and UVC "
"images for the **OpenMV Cam H7 Pro** (``OPENMV4_PRO``) are now bundled for "
"the first time (`08ac2e33f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/08ac2e33f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"將隨附的 OpenMV 韌體更新至 **v4.3.2**\\ ，並更新各開發板的韌體映像（\\ ``firmware.bin`` 加上 "
"``firmware.dfu``\\ 、\\ ``firmware.hex`` 或 ``firmware.uf2``\\ "
"，視開發板而定）、開機載入程式與 UVC 映像。OPENMV2、OPENMV3、OPENMV4、OPENMV4P、OPENMVPT、NICLAV 與 "
"PORTENTA 隨附 ``firmware.bin``/``firmware.dfu``\\ ；NANO33 隨附 "
"``firmware.bin``/``firmware.hex``\\ ；ARDUINO_NANO_RP2040_CONNECT 隨附 "
"``firmware.bin``/``firmware.uf2``\\ 。\\ **OpenMV Cam H7 Pro**\\ （\\ "
"``OPENMV4_PRO``\\ ）的全新韌體、開機載入程式與 UVC 映像現在首次隨附（\\ `08ac2e33f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/08ac2e33f>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:107
msgid ""
"Reorganized and expanded the bundled examples, including a new top-level "
"``00-HelloWorld``, a TensorFlow object-detection example, and many Arduino "
"Portenta-H7, Nicla-Vision, and Nano-RP2040 board-control, sensor, WiFi, "
"Bluetooth, and low-power examples (`08ac2e33f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/08ac2e33f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"重新整理並擴充了隨附的範例，包括新的頂層 ``00-HelloWorld``\\ 、一個 TensorFlow 物體偵測範例，以及許多 Arduino "
"Portenta-H7、Nicla-Vision 與 Nano-RP2040 的開發板控制、感測器、WiFi、Bluetooth 與低功耗範例（\\ "
"`08ac2e33f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/08ac2e33f>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:114
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "破壞性變更"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.7.rst:116
msgid ""
"None. This release is fully backward compatible with existing projects and "
"workflows."
msgstr "無。本次發行與既有專案和工作流程完全向後相容。"
